{"id":"harto","lemma":"harto","pos":"adj","rank":1885,"glosses":["tired, fed up","stuffed, sated (having the appetite satisfied)","many"],"ipa":"/ˈaɾto/","forms":{"feminine":"harta","masculinePlural":"hartos","femininePlural":"hartas"},"order":1921,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-harto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy harto de todo este ruido.","en":"I'm tired of all this noise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611286","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"noise"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"all kinds of things"]]},{"text":"Todos estamos hartos de esto.","en":"We're all sick of this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458867","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"Tengo harto tiempo para hacer eso.","en":"I have plenty of time to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767748","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"time"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]}]}